                                                          "geometry": "M8 16c4.41828 0 8-3.58172 8-8 0-4.41828-3.58172-8-8-8-4.41828 0-8 3.58172-8 8 0 4.41828 3.58172 8 8 8z m10.0002 1.99995l-4.3-4.3",
